    {
      "id": "moment-bf80f592-678d-47e2-a9b9-a59fd3dac26b",
      "experienceId": "experience-costa-rica-2025-casa-jungla",
      "postId": "bf80f592-678d-47e2-a9b9-a59fd3dac26b",
      "title": "San Jose AirBnb",
      "notes": "My wife loves plants, and this stay on the outskirts of San José is a surprise for her. I came across this Airbnb and thought it would be the perfect place for us to spend an evening. It’s one of the most unusual homes I’ve seen, a home that feels genuinely alive.\n\nWhat stands out to me is how personal it feels. I don’t think of it as just a rental. It’s someone’s home, with their heart and soul put into something the two of us get to share for a little while.",
